{"id":"112100-44-bccd","year":112,"exam":"112年第二次專門職業及技術人員高等考試醫師中醫師考試分階段考試（第一階段考試）、牙醫師藥師考試分階段考試、醫事檢驗師、醫事放射師、物理治療師考試、112年專門職業及技術人員高等考試職能治療師、呼吸治療師、獸醫師、助產師、心理師考試","level":"專技高考","subject":"微生物學與臨床微生物學（包括細菌與黴菌）","code":"4308","type":"測驗題","fixed":true,"classes":["醫事檢驗師"],"source":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=Q&code=112100&c=308&s=44&q=1","essays":[],"mcq":[{"no":1,"q":"在nitrate reduction test中陰性反應時，常需添加下列何種物質加以確定？","opts":["鋅","鉛","鈀","鋁"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":2,"q":"血液檢體進行細菌培養，最常使用下列何種抗凝劑？","opts":["sodium polyanethol sulfonate","heparin","citrate","ethylenediaminetetraacetic acid (EDTA)"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":3,"q":"細菌的孢子（spore）經革蘭氏染色，最可能呈現何種顏色？","opts":["紫色","黑色","無色","粉紅色"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":4,"q":"有關脈衝式電泳分析（pulsed-field gel electrophoresis）的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["一般被視為細菌分型的標準方法","需溶解細菌使其染色體DNA裸露","需複製細菌的染色體DNA","需使用限制酶（restriction endonucleases）切斷細菌的染色體DNA"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":5,"q":"生產醫療用塑膠空針（plastic syringe）時，採用下列何種方式滅菌較為適合？","opts":["紫外線","gamma射線","用水煮沸15分鐘","乾熱法"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":6,"q":"關於LIM broth的敘述，下列何者最適當？","opts":["通常用tryptic soy broth當基底培養基","常用於增殖咽喉檢體中之A群鏈球菌","是一種選擇及滋養性培養基","需添加penicillin及vancomycin"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":7,"q":"下列何者不是選擇性培養基？","opts":["eosin methylene blue（EMB）agar","MacConkey agar","Sheep blood agar","Tellurite agar"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":8,"q":"下列何種培養基不含膽鹽（bile salts）？","opts":["Salmonella-Shigella agar","Hektoen enteric agar","MacConkey agar","Phenylethyl alcohol agar"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":9,"q":"那一個Bacillus species與人類食物中毒最具相關性？","opts":["B. subtilis","B. cereus","B. circulans","B. coagulans"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":10,"q":"Tellurite medium主要用來分離那種細菌？","opts":["Corynebacterium diphtheriae","Erysipelothrix rhusiopathiae","Listeria monocytogenes","Actinomyces israelii"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":11,"q":"從年長之心內膜炎患者分離出一種人類腸胃道的常在菌，此菌為catalase陰性的革蘭氏陽性球菌，最可能是下列何種細菌？","opts":["Enterococcus faecalis","Staphylococcus epidermidis","Streptococcus pneumoniae","Eikenella corrodens"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":12,"q":"造成腸球菌（Enterococcus spp.）對vancomycin產生抗藥性的vanA基因通常由下列何者所攜帶？","opts":["plasmid","bacteriophage","sex pili","transposon"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":13,"q":"Immunochromatographic strip主要偵測下列何者來檢測Methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus（MRSA）？","opts":["mecA基因","spa基因","penicillinase","PBP2a"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":14,"q":"下列何種nontuberculous mycobacteria培養於25℃時為photochromogenic，培養於37℃時為scotochromogenic？","opts":["Mycobacterium szulgai","Mycobacterium xenopi","Mycobacterium haemophilum","Mycobacterium gordonae"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":15,"q":"下列何者最適合用於Staphylococcus epidermidis的分子分型？","opts":["spa sequence typing","SCCmec typing","emm sequence typing","multilocus sequence typing（MLST）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":16,"q":"下列何者最不可能在年長者造成腦膜炎（meningitis）？","opts":["Staphylococcus aureus","Streptococcus pneumoniae","Streptococcus pyogenes","Listeria monocytogenes"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":17,"q":"下列何者最不可能出現於健康個體之microbiota中？","opts":["Group A streptococci","Group G streptococci","Viridans streptococci","Enterococcus spp."],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":18,"q":"一般而言，下列何種試驗最不適合鑑定Staphylococcus及Micrococcus？","opts":["Susceptibility to bacitracin","Susceptibility to lysostaphin","Fermentation of glucose","Motility test"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":19,"q":"下列何者與Listeria monocytogenes之兼性胞內寄生能力最不相關？","opts":["ActA及internalin proteins","listeriolysin O","cord factor","phospholipase C"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":20,"q":"下列何種藥物組合最適合用在Enterococcus 